{"level":"debug","message":"Params: [{\"questions\":[{\"title\":\"3Sum\",\"isSolved\":true,\"bestScore\":100,\"testCases\":[{\"input\":\"6\\n-1 0 1 2 -1 -4\",\"expectedOutput\":\"-1 -1 2\\n-1 0 1\"},{\"input\":\"3\\n0 1 1\",\"expectedOutput\":\"\"}],\"questionId\":\"cmlv87nqk0012d64f1ljlxkdr\",\"defaultCode\":\"// Write your code here\\n\",\"description\":\"Given an integer array nums, return all the triplets [nums[i], nums[j], nums[k]] such that i != j, i != k, and j != k, and nums[i] + nums[j] + nums[k] == 0. The solution set must not contain duplicate triplets. Print each triplet on a new line.\\n\\n**Input Format**\\nFirst line: n (size of array)\\nSecond line: n space-separated integers\\n\\n**Output Format**\\nEach triplet on new line, space-separated, sorted order\\n\\n**Constraints**\\n- 3 <= n <= 3000\\n- -10^5 <= nums[i] <= 10^5\",\"submissions\":[{\"id\":\"d7ee2d08-0b1f-45af-abf3-13fb63e5a985\",\"code\":\"// Write your code here\\nimport java.util.*;\\n\\npublic class Main {\\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\\n\\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\\n        int[] nums = new int[n];\\n\\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n            nums[i] = sc.nextInt();\\n        }\\n\\n        Arrays.sort(nums);\\n\\n        for (int i = 0; i < n - 2; i++) {\\n\\n            // Skip duplicate first elements\\n            if (i > 0 && nums[i] == nums[i - 1])\\n                continue;\\n\\n            int left = i + 1;\\n            int right = n - 1;\\n\\n            while (left < right) {\\n                int sum = nums[i] + nums[left] + nums[right];\\n\\n                if (sum == 0) {\\n                    System.out.println(nums[i] + \\\" \\\" + nums[left] + \\\" \\\" + nums[right]);\\n\\n                    left++;\\n                    right--;\\n\\n                    // Skip duplicate second elements\\n                    while (left < right && nums[left] == nums[left - 1])\\n                        left++;\\n\\n                    // Skip duplicate third elements\\n                    while (left < right && nums[right] == nums[right + 1])\\n                        right--;\\n\\n                } else if (sum < 0) {\\n                    left++;\\n                } else {\\n                    right--;\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n\\n        sc.close();\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"status\":\"ACCEPTED\",\"stderr\":null,\"stdout\":null,\"languageId\":91,\"memoryUsed\":20139,\"submittedAt\":\"2026-02-20T18:46:55.088Z\",\"compileError\":null,\"languageName\":\"Java (OpenJDK 17)\",\"executionTime\":0.261,\"testCasesTotal\":4,\"testCasesPassed\":4}],\"displayOrder\":0,\"bestSubmissionId\":\"d7ee2d08-0b1f-45af-abf3-13fb63e5a985\",\"machineQuestionId\":\"cmluqams500p5zwnlffe9v460\"},{\"title\":\"Group Anagrams\",\"isSolved\":false,\"bestScore\":75,\"testCases\":[{\"input\":\"6\\neat tea tan ate nat bat\",\"expectedOutput\":\"eat tea ate\\ntan nat\\nbat\"},{\"input\":\"1\\na\",\"expectedOutput\":\"a\"}],\"questionId\":\"cmlv87nqk0013d64f60nv0zdi\",\"defaultCode\":\"// Write your code here\\n\",\"description\":\"Given an array of strings strs, group the anagrams together. An Anagram is a word formed by rearranging the letters of a different word. Print each group on a new line with words space-separated, groups in any order.\\n\\n**Input Format**\\nFirst line: n (number of strings)\\nSecond line: n space-separated strings\\n\\n**Output Format**\\nEach group on new line, words space-separated\\n\\n**Constraints**\\n- 1 <= n <= 10^4\\n- 0 <= strs[i].length <= 100\\n- strs[i] consists of lowercase English letters\",\"submissions\":[{\"id\":\"e1370de6-14e7-41ac-8e59-f0aa87b0aac6\",\"code\":\"import java.util.*;\\n\\npublic class Main {\\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\\n\\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\\n        String[] strs = new String[n];\\n\\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n            strs[i] = sc.next();\\n        }\\n\\n        // Map to store sorted key -> list of anagrams\\n        Map<String, List<String>> map = new HashMap<>();\\n\\n        for (String word : strs) {\\n            char[] chars = word.toCharArray();\\n            Arrays.sort(chars);\\n            String key = new String(chars);\\n\\n            map.putIfAbsent(key, new ArrayList<>());\\n            map.get(key).add(word);\\n        }\\n\\n        // Print groups\\n        for (List<String> group : map.values()) {\\n            for (String word : group) {\\n                System.out.print(word + \\\" \\\");\\n            }\\n            System.out.println();\\n        }\\n\\n        sc.close();\\n    }\\n}\\n\",\"languageId\":91,\"languageName\":\"Java (OpenJDK 17)\",\"status\":\"WRONG_ANSWER\",\"testCasesPassed\":3,\"testCasesTotal\":4,\"executionTime\":0.228,\"memoryUsed\":19449,\"stdout\":null,\"stderr\":null,\"compileError\":null,\"submittedAt\":\"2026-02-20T18:48:08.412Z\"}],\"displayOrder\":1,\"bestSubmissionId\":\"e1370de6-14e7-41ac-8e59-f0aa87b0aac6\",\"machineQuestionId\":\"cmluqamsd00q0zwnl8rgkitat\"}],\"_runResult\":{\"stderr\":\"Exception in thread \\\"main\\\" java.util.NoSuchElementException\\n\\tat java.base/java.util.Scanner.throwFor(Scanner.java:937)\\n\\tat java.base/java.util.Scanner.next(Scanner.java:1594)\\n\\tat java.base/java.util.Scanner.nextInt(Scanner.java:2258)\\n\\tat java.base/java.util.Scanner.nextInt(Scanner.java:2212)\\n\\tat Main.main(Main.java:7)\\n\",\"stdout\":null,\"executionTime\":0.054}},145,\"2026-02-20 18:48:08.417 UTC\",\"cmlv8mexr001id64fy16vt87r\"]","service":"preplyte-api","timestamp":"2026-02-21 00:18:08"}
